<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cadbury plans 10-for-one share split.</title>
<headline>Cadbury plans 10-for-one share split.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cadbury Schweppes (South Africa) Ltd said on Tuesday it planned a 10-for-one share split to improve the marketability of its stock.</p>
<p>The group said the sub-division was effective from June 30, subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
